  <h2>Caveats</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>The function silently fails if its <b>face</b> value indicates a face that does not exist.</li>
    <li>llSetLinkAlpha will have no visible effect on faces with a PBR material. To work on faces both with and without a PBR material, use one of these snippets:
    <ul>
      <li><p>invisible</p>
  <div class="lua-block"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll = llcompat
  
  
  
  if ll.IsLinkGLTFMaterial(LINK_THIS, ALL_SIDES) ~= 0 then
      ll.SetLinkGLTFOverrides(PRIM_GLTF_ALPHA_MODE_BLEND, OVERRIDE_GLTF_BASE_ALPHA, 0.0)
      OVERRIDE_GLTF_BASE_ALPHA_MODE
      ALL_SIDES
  else
      ll.SetLinkAlpha(LINK_THIS, 0.0, ALL_SIDES)
  end
  `} lang="slua" /></div>
  <div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`
  if (llIsLinkGLTFMaterial(LINK_THIS, ALL_SIDES)) {
      llSetLinkGLTFOverrides(LINK_THIS, ALL_SIDES, [OVERRIDE_GLTF_BASE_ALPHA_MODE, PRIM_GLTF_ALPHA_MODE_BLEND, OVERRIDE_GLTF_BASE_ALPHA, 0.0)]);
  } else {
      llSetLinkAlpha(LINK_THIS, 0.0, ALL_SIDES);
  }
  `} lang="lsl" /></div>
  
  </li>
      <li><p>visible</p>
  <div class="lua-block"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll = llcompat
  
  
  
  if ll.IsLinkGLTFMaterial(LINK_THIS, ALL_SIDES) ~= 0 then
      ll.SetLinkGLTFOverrides("", OVERRIDE_GLTF_BASE_ALPHA, "")
      OVERRIDE_GLTF_BASE_ALPHA_MODE
      ALL_SIDES
  else
      ll.SetLinkAlpha(LINK_THIS, 1.0, ALL_SIDES)
  end
  `} lang="slua" /></div>
  <div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`
  if (llIsLinkGLTFMaterial(LINK_THIS, ALL_SIDES)) {
      llSetLinkGLTFOverrides(LINK_THIS, ALL_SIDES, [OVERRIDE_GLTF_BASE_ALPHA_MODE, "", OVERRIDE_GLTF_BASE_ALPHA, "")]);
  } else {
      llSetLinkAlpha(LINK_THIS, 1.0, ALL_SIDES);
  }
  `} lang="lsl" /></div>
  
  </li>
